  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {妊娠|にんしん}する: to become pregnant\n- {妊娠|にんしん}{中|ちゅう}: during pregnancy\n- {妊娠|にんしん}{検査|けんさ}: pregnancy test\n- {妊娠|にんしん}〜{週|しゅう}: (number) weeks pregnant\n- {妊娠|にんしん}{初期|しょき}: early pregnancy\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {妊婦|にんぷ}: pregnant woman\n- {出産|しゅっさん}: childbirth\n- {産婦人科|さんふじんか}: obstetrics and gynecology\n- {安定期|あんていき}: stable period (of pregnancy, usually after week 16)",
